I'm verifying that the share button click satisfies the user activation requirement for `navigator.share`. The button's event handler is now integrated within `IdeaCard.tsx`. My current focus is refining the simple visual feedback. An alert is working, but it can be intrusive, so I'm investigating alternative UI elements to confirm the clipboard copy. I'm leveraging the existing flex container for alignment, ensuring the share icon aligns with the return text visually.


