I've been working to refine the share content display. I'm adding a shared container for the return and share button. To address the edge case of potentially long summaries, I will need to consider text truncation or a more elegant layout adjustment to keep the UI clean.  I will group the share button with the return percentage, and address the summary issue separately.


**Integrating Share Text**

I'm now focusing on the share text. It should include the ticker and summary. I'll dynamically construct the message in `IdeaCard.tsx`, making sure it's well-formatted. I'm also ensuring the link to the original source is included in the share data. The length of the summary is a minor consideration, but it is fine now.

