I'm working to enhance the card by adding a ticker summary and TradingView Widget. These will provide a more detailed view. I will integrate a display of past returns as well.


**Improving Contextual Information**

I'm enhancing the display by adding source information and a link to the original source to the `IdeaCard` component. The source and original link are now visible at the bottom of the card, next to the summary. This change improves the contextual information and transparency. The truncated display for the sources makes the card cleaner.
